# APP_PROMPT.prompt
# StudyOS — Enterprise-Grade LLM Prompt Library
# End-to-end build prompts: Auth, DB, Agents, UI, Analytics, MCP, Skills, Design
# Use with: Cursor | Claude Projects | Windsurf | v0.dev | any LLM
