## ║  PROMPT 6 — MCP INTEGRATIONS                            ║
## ╚══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝

Build all MCP (Model Context Protocol) integrations for StudyOS.

Integration 1 — Google Drive MCP:
  Purpose: Two-way sync between StudyOS notes and Google Drive
  OAuth setup: Google OAuth 2.0, scope: drive.file (not full drive access)
  Functions:
    - connectDrive(): OAuth flow → store token securely
    - pushChapterToDrive(chapterId): generate markdown → upload as Google Doc
    - pullFromDrive(fileId): download Google Doc → create note in StudyOS
    - createStudyOSFolder(): create "StudyOS NEET 2026" root folder
    - syncAll(): push all notes to Drive (bulk operation with progress)
  UI:
    <DriveIntegrationCard /> — connect/disconnect, sync status, last synced
    <DrivePickerModal /> — browse Drive files to import

Integration 2 — NotebookLM Export:
  Purpose: Export notes in perfect NotebookLM source format
  Functions:
    - exportChapterAsMarkdown(chapterId): generate optimized .md file
    - exportSubjectAsZip(subjectId): bundle all chapters as ZIP
    - exportAllAsZip(): full syllabus export
  Markdown format (generate the exact template):
    - NEET-optimized headers
    - Key concepts section
    - Formulas/reactions table
    - High-yield points
    - Common mistakes
    - Practice questions (3 per chapter)
    - Student's own notes section
  UI:
    <NotebookLMExportModal /> — chapter/subject selector + format options + download

Integration 3 — WhatsApp Business API (via Twilio):
  Purpose: Study reminders + weekly reports + milestone alerts
  Functions:
    - sendDailyReminder(userId): scheduled 7 AM message
    - sendWeeklyReport(userId): Sunday evening progress summary
    - sendMilestoneAlert(userId, milestone): e.g., "Biology 50% complete 🎉"
    - sendParentReport(userId, parentPhone): weekly report to parent
    - sendExamCountdown(userId, daysRemaining): weekly countdown
  Message templates (WhatsApp Business requires pre-approved templates):
    - daily_reminder: "Good morning {{name}}! 🌅 Today's focus: {{chapter}}. You're on a {{streak}}-day streak! 🔥"
    - weekly_report: text with study stats
    - milestone: celebration message
  Opt-in/out: student must explicitly opt in; one-tap opt-out in settings
  Supabase Edge Function: whatsapp-scheduler (cron trigger)

Integration 4 — YouTube Study Content:
  Purpose: Link relevant YouTube lectures to each chapter
  Functions:
    - searchLectures(chapterName, subject): YouTube Data API search
    - getChannelPlaylists(): curated NEET channels (Physics Wallah, Vedantu, etc.)
    - saveVideoToChapter(chapterId, videoId): bookmark a lecture
    - getChapterVideos(chapterId): list saved + recommended videos
  Curated channels:
    Physics Wallah, Vedantu NEET, Unacademy NEET, Doubtnut, ALLEN Career
  UI:
    <ChapterVideos /> — scrollable video card list within chapter view
    Thumbnail + duration + channel name + "Watch" button (opens YouTube)

Integration 5 — Razorpay Payments:
  Purpose: Student Pro subscription + Institute plans
  Plans:
    Free: 3 subjects, basic checklist, 50 AI messages/month
    Student Pro: ₹299/month or ₹1999/year — unlimited AI, all features, offline
    Institute: custom pricing, per-seat, teacher dashboard
  Functions:
    - createSubscription(planId, userId): Razorpay subscription
    - handleWebhook(payload): update subscription status in DB
    - cancelSubscription(subscriptionId): cancel + maintain until period end
    - getInvoices(userId): list payment history
  UI:
    <PricingPage /> — plan comparison table (Free vs Pro vs Institute)
    <UpgradeModal /> — shown when hitting free tier limits
    <BillingSettings /> — manage subscription, download invoices

Output:
  - src/integrations/ directory (one file per integration)
  - Supabase Edge Functions for server-side operations (webhook handling, cron jobs)
  - UI components for each integration
  - Environment variable reference (.env.example)
  - Integration setup guides in INTEGRATIONS.md

