## ╔══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗
## ║  PROMPT 8 — OFFLINE-FIRST + PWA                         ║
## ╚══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝

Build the offline-first architecture and PWA configuration for StudyOS.

Offline Strategy (for Indian students with poor connectivity):

What works offline:
  - View and complete chapter checklists (Dexie.js)
  - Read and edit notes (Dexie.js)
  - View roadmap (cached in Dexie)
  - View downloaded quiz questions (cached)
  - Read previous AI chat history (Dexie)

What requires internet:
  - New AI chat messages
  - Roadmap regeneration
  - Note file upload + OCR (or use device camera → process later)
  - Sync progress to cloud

Dexie.js Schema (dexie-schema.ts):
  Build complete Dexie database with:
    - chapters table (full chapter + topic + subtopic data, synced from Supabase)
    - progress table (local copy of completions, to be synced)
    - notes table (full note content offline)
    - roadmap table (current active roadmap)
    - chat_sessions + messages (history)
    - sync_queue (pending operations to push when back online)
    - metadata (last_sync_at per table)

Sync Engine (sync-engine.ts):
  - Background sync: when app comes online, push sync_queue items
  - Conflict resolution: last-write-wins with server as authority
  - Incremental sync: only fetch changes since last_sync_at
  - Sync status indicator in UI: "Synced 2 min ago" / "Offline — changes saved locally"

Service Worker (Serwist / Workbox for Next.js):
  - Cache strategy per resource type:
    - App shell (layout, navigation): Cache First
    - NCERT images/diagrams: Cache First with 7-day expiry
    - API responses: Network First with Stale-While-Revalidate
    - Static assets: Cache First with version hash
  - Background sync for offline form submissions
  - Push notification handler (for WhatsApp-style reminders via FCM)

PWA Manifest (manifest.json):
  - name: "StudyOS"
  - short_name: "StudyOS"
  - theme_color: #4F46E5 (brand indigo)
  - background_color: #0F172A (dark)
  - display: standalone
  - orientation: portrait-primary
  - icons: all sizes (72, 96, 128, 144, 152, 192, 384, 512)
  - shortcuts: [Open Notes, Open Today's Roadmap, Ask AI]
  - screenshots: 4 mobile screenshots for Play Store listing

Install Prompt:
  <PWAInstallPrompt /> — smart timing (show after 2 study sessions, not immediately)
  Store in Dexie whether user dismissed it (don't show again for 7 days)

Offline UI Indicators:
  <OfflineBanner /> — subtle top banner when offline
  <SyncStatus /> — in settings, shows last sync time per data type
  All async operations: handle offline error gracefully (queue + inform user)

Output:
  - Complete Dexie schema and initialization
  - sync-engine.ts
  - Service worker configuration (Serwist integration in next.config.ts)
  - manifest.json
  - <PWAInstallPrompt />, <OfflineBanner />, <SyncStatus />
  - useOfflineStatus() hook
  - useSyncEngine() hook

