  4. **Reference authority:** docs/architecture/FINAL_ARCHITECTURE.md (tech decisions)
  5. **Follow phases:** docs/architecture/IMPLEMENTATION_PHASES.md

QUICK START:
  Phase 0: pnpm install && turbo run lint typecheck build
  Phase 1: Auth + Syllabus (SKILL_BACKEND.md + SKILL_DATABASE.md)
  2. Upload NEET_2026_Complete_Syllabus_Guide.md as domain knowledge
  3. Use prompts 1–13 as individual conversations
  4. Reference "as defined in APP_MAP.md" to maintain consistency

WITH CURSOR / WINDSURF:
  1. Open project → .cursor/rules → paste MASTER CONTEXT
  2. Add /skills/ directory → AI reads automatically
  3. Use prompts as inline chat commands: "Implement PROMPT 7 Feature 1"

